        "toolDescription": "Performs a Google search to verify internship eligibility. Use this ONLY when the provided text is ambiguous or missing the batch year (e.g., '2027'). CRITICAL: You must provide a specific query string (e.g., 'Google Software Engineer Intern 2027 eligibility').",
        "method": "POST",
